## IAssistantPlugin

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Contracts`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Core`

### Purpose
Adds additional services/features/functions to an `IAssistantMode`. Plugins are loaded when a kernel is created for a chat.

### Properties
| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `Id` | `string` | Unique identifier for the plugin |
| `Modes` | `string[]` | Mode IDs this plugin applies to. Empty array = all modes |
| `Priority` | `int` | Execution priority (higher = loaded first) |
| `Required` | `bool` | If true, cannot be deactivated |
| `Title` | `string` | Display title for UI |

### Methods

#### LoadAsync(CyrenaKernelBuilder builder)
Applies the plugin to the kernel being built.
- Register Semantic Kernel plugins via `builder.Plugins.AddFromType<T>()`
- Add kernel-scoped services via `builder.Services`
- Access feature options via `builder.GetFeatureOption<T>()`

### Implementation Example
```csharp
internal class DefaultAssistantPlugin : IAssistantPlugin
{
    public string[] Modes => [IAssistantMode.AssistantModeDefault];
    public int Priority => 10;
    public string Id => "cyrena.default";
    public bool Required => true;
    public string Title => "Default Assistant";

    public Task LoadAsync(CyrenaKernelBuilder builder)
    {
        builder.Plugins.AddFromType<Chat>();
        return Task.CompletedTask;
    }
}
```

### Registration
```csharp
builder.AddAssistantPlugin<DefaultAssistantPlugin>();
```

### Plugin Loading Logic (from KernelController)
```csharp
IEnumerable<IAssistantPlugin> plugins = _services.GetServices<IAssistantPlugin>()
    .Where(x => x.Modes.Length == 0 || x.Modes.Contains(mode.Id));

if (!config.PluginIds.Any())
    config.PluginIds = plugins.Select(x => x.Id).ToList();

foreach (var plugin in plugins.OrderByDescending(x => x.Priority))
{
    if(config.PluginIds.Any(x => x == plugin.Id) || plugin.Required)
        await plugin.LoadAsync(cyrenaKernelBuilder);
}
```

### Related
- `IAssistantMode` - The mode this plugin extends
- `CyrenaKernelBuilder` - Builder passed to LoadAsync
- `KernelController` - Loads plugins when creating kernels
